1
00:00:00,592 --> 00:00:02,562
(Raj:)Is that enough
to melt the lug nut?

2
00:00:02,561 --> 00:00:03,531
(Leonard:)Well, let's start small.

3
00:00:03,528 --> 00:00:04,558
(Leonard:)We can always add more.

4
00:00:04,563 --> 00:00:07,493
(Howard:)You put up a good fight,
lug nut,

5
00:00:07,499 --> 00:00:11,199
(Howard:)but you've met your match.

6
00:00:28,586 --> 00:00:29,816
Hey, look!

7
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:32,521
(Raj:)The lug nut's off.

8
00:00:45,705 --> 00:00:47,175
(Leonard:)What...

9
00:00:47,174 --> 00:00:49,304
(Leonard:)What are you
doing back?

10
00:00:51,444 --> 00:00:52,844
(Leonard:)We got a flat

11
00:00:52,846 --> 00:00:54,146
(Leonard:)and couldn't get
the tire off.

12
00:00:54,147 --> 00:00:55,977
(Penny:)Oh, I'm sorry.

13
00:00:55,982 --> 00:00:57,312
(Amy:)Thank you.

14
00:00:57,317 --> 00:00:58,787
(Penny:)If it makes you feel any better,

15
00:00:58,785 --> 00:01:00,085
(Penny:)I pierced Amy's ears

16
00:01:00,087 --> 00:01:02,857
(Penny:)and her mom made her sit
in my closet.

17
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:08,689
(Sheldon:)We blew up Feynman's van.

18
00:01:08,695 --> 00:01:11,265
(Penny:)My dad killed my pig
with his tractor.

19
00:01:11,264 --> 00:01:13,694
(Leonard:)I spent the night
in Mexico with Sheldon.

20
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,040
(Penny:)You win.

